Formal fraction uncertainty is ±0.20 wt%; realistic model-dependent uncertainty is approximately ±2 wt%. Triclinic WO₃ is preferred, though monoclinic WO₃ remains the principal structural ambiguity. Fractions exclude possible amorphous material.

